{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"options":{"content":"","images":{},"widgets":{}},"periodicTable":false,"type":"multiple"},"hints":[{"content":"We can play around with the expressions in the answer choices to see if they are the same as $5(-2k-3)+2k$.","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's see if the first expression is equivalent to $5(-2k-3)+2k$.\n\n$\\qquad\n\\begin{align}\n\\\\\\\\\n{(-5\\cdot3)-8k}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} 5(-2k-3)+2k  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{(-5\\cdot3)-8k}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} (5)(-2k)-(5)3+2k   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{(-5\\cdot3)-8k}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -10k-15+2k   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{(-5\\cdot3)-8k}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -8k-15   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-15-8k}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -8k-15   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-8k-15 }   \u0026= -8k-15  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n \\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's see if the second expression is equivalent to $5(-2k-3)+2k$.\n\n$\\qquad\n\\begin{align}\n\\\\\\\\\n{-15}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} 5(-2k-3)+2k \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-15}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}  (5)(-2k)-(5)3+2k   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-15}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -10k-15+2k   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-15}   \u0026\\ne  -8k-15\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n \\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expression is equivalent to $5(-2k-3)+2k$ :\n\n\n-  ${(-5\\cdot3)-8k} $\n","images":{},"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Which expressions are equivalent to $5(-2k-3)+2k$ ?**  \n\n[[☃ radio 1]]\n\n","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$(-5\\cdot3)-8k$","correct":true},{"content":"$-15$","correct":false},{"isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"onePerLine":true,"randomize":false},"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
